{"id":"660381","name":"冬瓜玉米大骨汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660381/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"大骨","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"大骨冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净备用。","img":"images/660381/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净的大骨放入砂锅里。","img":"images/660381/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/660381/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大火煮开煲1小时左右。","img":"images/660381/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"冬瓜去皮去籽洗净切块。","img":"images/660381/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"玉米洗净切段。","img":"images/660381/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"小时后大骨汤煲好。","img":"images/660381/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入冬瓜先煲十分钟左右。","img":"images/660381/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"最后放入玉米。","img":"images/660381/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煲至玉米断生，小火盐调味即可。","img":"images/660381/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660381/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660381/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660381/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}